## Erlang VM args for Android release
-mode embedded

## Distributed Erlang - DISABLED until crypto/OpenSSL is built for Android
## -name probnik@127.0.0.1
## -setcookie secret_token

## Limit schedulers for mobile
+S 2:2
+SDcpu 2:2

## Memory settings for constrained environment
+MBas aobf
+MBlmbcs 512

## Disable shell (no terminal on Android)
+Bd -noinput
